{"toolCallId":"call_bdb513883bd349379b4dd3a16c6a4bb2","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"8:# Options: --verbose/-v, --json/-j, --file/-f <path>, --quality/-q, --help/-h\n61:  exit 1\n67:OVERALL_PERCENTAGE=100\n82:  --verbose, -v              Show detailed per-file breakdown\n90:  calculate-completeness.sh --verbose specs/001-feature-name/\n95:  exit 0\n290:  OVERALL_PERCENTAGE=100\n292:    OVERALL_PERCENTAGE=$(echo \"scale=2; (1 - $TOTAL_PLACEHOLDERS / $TOTAL_LINES) * 100\" | bc)\n293:    OVERALL_PERCENTAGE=$(printf \"%.0f\" \"$OVERALL_PERCENTAGE\")\n296:    # which errexit would turn into a silent exit before any output.\n297:    if [[ \"$OVERALL_PERCENTAGE\" -lt 0 ]]; then\n298:      OVERALL_PERCENTAGE=0\n301:    OVERALL_PERCENTAGE=0\n348:    echo \"Overall Completion: ${OVERALL_PERCENTAGE}%\"\n386:    percentage=${OVERALL_PERCENTAGE}\n475:    echo \"  \\\"overall_completion\\\": ${OVERALL_PERCENTAGE},\"\n544:while [[ $# -gt 0 ]]; do\n545:  case \"$1\" in\n546:    --verbose|-v) VERBOSE=true; shift ;;\n557:        exit 1\n567:  exit 1\n572:  exit 1\n587:exit 0\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w8a66e200e3/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"adbf4c","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
